{% extends "base.html.jinja" %}
{% block content %}
<h1>Support</h1>
{% if support_email %}
<p class="lede">Email <a href="mailto:{{ support_email }}">{{ support_email }}</a>.</p>
{% else %}
<p class="lede">A support address will be listed here before the app is released.</p>
{% endif %}
<h2>Questions</h2>
<dl>
  <dt>Is a lake with no advisory OK to swim in?</dt>
  <dd>The records cannot say. Most waters are never tested. See <a href="{{ root }}about/#limits">the limits of the data</a>.</dd>
  <dt>Why does an old advisory still show?</dt>
  <dd>The state never recorded an end for it. It stays listed, with its date, until the state does.</dd>
  <dt>A lake's record looks wrong.</dt>
  <dd>The records are the state's. Data questions go to {{ source.contact }}. Problems with this site go to the address above.</dd>
  <dt>When do app alerts arrive?</dt>
  <dd>Within about a day of the state publishing an advisory. iOS decides exactly when the app checks.</dd>
</dl>
{% endblock %}
